From 5065e6342f6c6923db759846aa09a753c54525ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rubik <huajianfeng@zhejianglab.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:34:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(metax): add MoE, GDN, quantization and attention
 operators for MetaX GPUs

  Add native MetaX (MACA) device kernels and linked torch operator
  providers so InfiniLM can run on MetaX C550 GPUs:

  - Native ops (src/native/cuda/metax): moe_fused_gate,
    moe_fused_dense, deepseek_moe, chunked/recurrent gated delta
    rule (linear attention), mamba_selective_scan, causal_conv1d,
    mrope, w4_marlin, per-tensor/per-channel int8 quant kernels
  - Linked torch ops (src/linked/torch/metax): vLLM providers for
    moe_align_block_size, topk_sigmoid, quick_gelu; ATen providers
    for layer_norm, pad; flash_attn_varlen_func, rms_norm and
    silu_and_mul updates
  - Shared CUDA reference kernels for moe_fused_dense
    (src/native/cuda/ops)

  Validated end-to-end with qwen3.8-27B (TP2, batch size 1): TTFT 350.23 ms, decode 29.78 tok/s.

